WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.075
The supplies have reached the coast.

00:00:03.075 --> 00:00:06.550
Now they must reach the people inland.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:16.450
You take command from the other side of the corridor, where a surveillance sweep is approaching and an evacuation convoy still needs a way home.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:22.800
Disperse your mobile force, protect the deliveries, and keep the return route open.
